  "id": "nationalism",
  "term": "nationalism",
  "definition": "Nationalism is a complex social phenomenon involving civic pride, cultural identity, loyalty to institutions, and shared ethnic or symbolic resources. It centers on defining who belongs to the group and who does not, and in digital media it can become especially visible in more exclusionary and aggressive public expressions.",
